[{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0029","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-4940","title":"WordPress TeraCharts 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"WordPress Tera Charts 插件 0.1 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，由于未能正确过滤 `charts/treemap.php` 和 `charts/zoomabletreemap.php` 中 `fn` 参数的用户输入，允许未经身份认证的远程攻击者通过 `../` 路径穿越序列读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需任何认证，利用复杂度低，仅需向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4940"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-07-11T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:10:48Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 Tera Charts (tera-charts) 插件 0.1 版本，该插件已长期未维护且无安全更新。如仍需使用图表功能，请替换为其他受支持的 WordPress 图表插件（如 Chartify 或 Visualizer）。同时，在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）配置中禁用 `fn` 参数对文件系统的目录遍历访问，添加规则拦截 `../` 路径模式。作为深层防护，确保 WordPress 安装目录 `wp-content/plugins/` 具有最小权限（755），并启用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截路径遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://codevigilant.com/disclosure/wp-plugin-tera-chart-local-file-inclusion/","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset?sfp_email=&sfph_mail=&reponame=&new=851874%40tera-charts&old=799253%40tera-charts&sfp_email=&sfph_mail=","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39257","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4940.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-4940.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4940.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-4940/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-4940.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2014-4940-2385.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-4940_2.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2014-4940-2382.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2014-4940.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2014-4940-2385.yaml","https://github.com/thompson005/nuclei-scanner/blob/6b5cfd844640c882a3d278f76f395a74ee14ef81/nucleivault/new%20templates/CVE-2014-4940-2384.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2014/4xxx/CVE-2014-4940.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0017","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-4513","title":"WordPress Plugin ActiveHelper LiveHelp Live Chat 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"ActiveHelper LiveHelp Live Chat 插件（WordPress）中 server/offline.php 存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，在 3.1.0 及更早版本中，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 MESSAGE、EMAIL 或 NAME 参数注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时脚本执行，导致敏感信息窃取、会话劫持等危害。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4513"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-07-01T14:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:10:09Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 ActiveHelper LiveHelp Live Chat 插件，该插件已于 2017 年关闭下架且不再接收安全更新。建议迁移至其他仍在维护的 WordPress 在线客服插件（如 WP Live Chat Support 或 Chaty）。如因业务依赖暂时无法删除，至少升级到 4.7.0 版本（已知最后版本），并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加针对 server/offline.php 中 MESSAGE、EMAIL、NAME 参数的输入过滤规则，拦截 <script> 等 HTML 标签。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://codevigilant.com/disclosure/wp-plugin-activehelper-livehelp-a3-cross-site-scripting-xss","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4513.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-4513.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/edc652d6e05ef25aee5fb9d5d13e49f90fcfe6b7/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4513.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-4513/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-4513.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-4513_4.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-4513_1.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2014-4513-2345.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2014-4513-2344.yaml","https://github.com/pushpak-11/customTemplates/blob/575b0557827c8eaed2523555e3acfd3fa51090f4/nuclei-templates/CVE-2014-4513.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2014-4513.js","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-4513_5.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0019","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-4536","title":"WordPress Infusionsoft Gravity Forms 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Infusionsoft Gravity Forms插件1.5.6之前版本中的tests/notAuto_test_ContactService_pauseCampaign.php文件存在多个反射型跨站脚本漏洞，远程攻击者能够通过go、contactId和campaignId参数注入任意Web脚本或HTML，在用户浏览器中执行恶意代码，导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4536"],"sources":["cve","nuclei"],"published":"2014-07-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级WordPress Infusionsoft Gravity Forms插件至1.5.6或更高版本，对用户输入进行严格的过滤和转义处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T17:14:17Z","references":["http://codevigilant.com/disclosure/wp-plugin-infusionsoft-a3-cross-site-scripting-xss","http://wordpress.org/plugins/infusionsoft/changelog"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0012","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-2962","title":"Belkin N150 路由器目录遍历漏洞","description":"Belkin N150 F9K1009 v1 路由器固件 1.00.08 之前版本中的 webproc CGI 模块存在绝对路径遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 getpage 参数提交完整路径名，绕过访问限制读取设备上的任意文件，包括敏感配置信息。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。厂商已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-2962"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-06-19T10:50:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:07:24Z","remediation":"升级 Belkin N150 F9K1009 v1 路由器固件至 1.00.08 或更高版本。在官方固件不可获取时，禁用路由器的远程管理功能（WAN 侧管理），并将管理页面限定为仅内网 IP 访问，同时限制对 /cgi-bin/webproc 路径的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.belkin.com/us/support-article?articleNum=109400","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/774788","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38488/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38488","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2962.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-2962.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/edc652d6e05ef25aee5fb9d5d13e49f90fcfe6b7/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2962.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-2962/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-2962.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2014-2962-2313.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2014/2xxx/CVE-2014-2962.json","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2014-2962-2312.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Belkin%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%99%A8/CVE-2014-2962.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2014-2962-2315.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2014-2962-2312_1.yaml","https://github.com/chessredoffsec/nuclei-templates/blob/bf798045b1c57839b4998bf6e08c74fbfd076879/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2962.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0209","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-3153","title":"Linux Kernel 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 futex 子系统中的 futex_requeue 函数存在条件竞争漏洞，该函数未能确保两次调用使用不同的 futex 地址，导致本地攻击者可通过精心构造的 FUTEX_REQUEUE 命令触发不安全的等待队列修改，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 3.14.5 及之前版本，主要波及 CentOS 7、RHEL 等企业级发行版。攻击者需具备本地用户权限即可利用，无需交互，利用复杂度低。公开的利用工具（如 libfutex/towelroot）已广泛传播，可实现从普通用户到 root 权限的完全提升，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性均造成严重威胁。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），实际危害性极高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-3153"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-06-07T14:55:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:07:40Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 3.14.6 或更高版本（包含补丁 commit e9c243a5a6de0be8e584c604d353412584b592f8）。CentOS 7/RHEL 用户可通过 `yum update kernel` 更新至包含修复的内核包，重启后生效。如无法立即升级，可通过 SELinux 策略限制本地用户执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux-2.6.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=e9c243a5a6de0be8e584c604d353412584b592f8","http://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2014-0771.html","http://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2014-3037.html","http://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2014-3038.html","http://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2014-3039.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-06/msg00014.html","http