账户时，密码以 AES-256 加密后存储在 SYSVOL 共享目录的 XML 文件中，但加密密钥已被公开泄露。域内任意经过身份认证的远程攻击者只需具备对域控制器 SYSVOL 共享的读取权限，即可获取加密的 cpassword 值，并使用公开的 AES 密钥解密得到明文密码，进而利用获取的凭据提升权限至域管理员。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1 及 Windows Server 2012 Gold/R2 等多个版本，已于 2014 年 5 月在野外被积极利用（MS14-025），CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-1812"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-05-14T11:13:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:05:35Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS14-025 (KB2928120) 补丁，该补丁阻止通过 SYSVOL 共享读取组策略首选项中的加密密码。同时检查 SYSVOL 中所有 Groups.xml 文件，删除其中包含的 cpassword 字段，改用受保护的组策略首选项或受管理的服务帐户 (gMSA) 替代明文/可逆加密密码存储方式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2014/05/13/ms14-025-an-update-for-group-policy-preferences.aspx","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-025","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-1812","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-1812.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/2014/CVE-2014-1812.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-1812","https://github.com/infosecn1nja/AD-Attack-Defense/blob/64d2a9ac720edc69c09b486bb36b256cc035ae4b/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-1812/README_KO.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-1812.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/SSVC/data/2014/CVE-2014-1812.json","https://github.com/blackninja23/blackninja23.github.io/blob/87a5a85375273f5ecb06a80b46ad8b86ee5124dd/tags/gpp-group-xml-leaking-cpassword(ms14-025)(cve-2014-1812).html","https://github.com/AJMartel/IRTriage/blob/edfc35dde062c32bd4e03deb821c88ed6fc65d83/Compile/Tools/Misc/Readme.txt","https://github.com/mauricelambert/gpp-encrypt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0077","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-0196","title":"Linux kernel n_tty 条件竞争本地提权漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 drivers/tty/n_tty.c 文件中的 n_tty_write 函数在处理 LECHO 与 !OPOST 组合模式时存在条件竞争漏洞。当本地用户通过读写操作传入超长字符串时，由于 tty 驱动程序访问权限管理不当，可触发内存破坏，导致系统崩溃或权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 3.14.3 及之前版本，攻击者需具备本地用户权限，利用公开的竞争条件利用程序（如 ExploitDB 33516）即可实现提权，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2014-0196"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-05-07T10:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:02:29Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 3.15-rc4 或更高版本（commit 4291086b），该提交修复了 n_tty_write 函数在 LECHO & !OPOST 模式下的竞态条件问题。如无法升级内核，可通过限制本地用户对 PTY 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施，或使用 grsecurity/PaX 等内核加固补丁降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.novell.com/show_bug.cgi?id=875690","http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux-2.6.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=4291086b1f081b869c6d79e5b7441633dc3ace00","http://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2014-0771.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-05/msg00007.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-05/msg00012.html","http://pastebin.com/raw.php?i=yTSFUBgZ","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2014-0512.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/59218","http://secunia.com/advisories/59262","http://secunia.com/advisories/59599","http://source.android.com/security/bulletin/2016-07-01.html","http://support.f5.com/kb/en-us/solutions/public/15000/300/sol15319.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2014/dsa-2926"