7T00:05:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 Titan FTP Server 至 10.40 build 1829 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Web 接口中 search-bar 参数路径遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙层面限制对 Titan FTP Server Web 管理界面（默认端口 80/443）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的 Web 管理功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/fulldisclosure/2014-02/0092.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/31579","http://www.osvdb.org/103196","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2014/CVE-2014-1842.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-1842.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/network/cves/2014/CVE-2014-1842.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2014/1xxx/CVE-2014-1842.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-1842","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/21879.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2014/CVE-2014-1842.json","https://github.com/Jaboxx/offensive-security-exploit-database/blob/50c008ba068a25e5ea3cd10849227234620da5f1/exploits/windows/webapps/31579.txt","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2014/1xxx/CVE-2014-1843.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2014/CVE-2014-1842.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2014-1842.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0005","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-1841","title":"Titan FTP Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Titan FTP Server 10.40 build 1829之前版本的Web接口存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。远程攻击者可通过向Move操作中的src参数提交包含\"..\"（点点）的恶意路径，绕过目录限制，跨目录复制任意用户的home文件夹内容。该漏洞影响Titan FTP Server 10.40 build 1829及更早版本，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞获取敏感文件，建议用户升级至10.40 build 1829或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-1841"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-04-29T10:37:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:05:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 Titan FTP Server 至 10.40 build 1829 或更高版本，该版本已修复对 src 参数中 `..` 目录遍历序列的过滤。如无法升级，可在 web 界面前置反向代理中限制 Move 请求的 src 参数包含父目录跳转，或禁用 web 管理接口的远程访问。建议同时限制可访问 web 管理界面的 IP 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/fulldisclosure/2014-02/0092.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/31579","http://www.osvdb.org/103195","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/65462","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2014/CVE-2014-1841.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/network/cves/2014/CVE-2014-1841.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2014/1xxx/CVE-2014-1841.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-1841","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/c32f16c3f9ed4fa16e17d46fd347fa883ce6cae3/reports/network/cves/2014/CVE-2014-1841.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/21879.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x66000/65462/info.html","https://github.com/LoveCppp/dotfiles/blob/b1f686953bf3866c0835804fd2b588f8f03b6d4d/bin/exploits/platforms/windows/webapps/31579.txt","https://github.com/roy9495/CVE-Extractor/blob/21bc96060eb3124bb762be8e16b95c7e2b15d4dc/cvelistV5-main/cves/2014/1xxx/CVE-2014-1843.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-reserve/blob/c1581dbabe569bc0543baa46ed25f8fdd1555b2b/nvd/2014/CVE-2014-1841.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-1841_13.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0005.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2014/EXP-AVE-2014-0005.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0010","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-2383","title":"dompdf dompdf.php 远程任意文件读取漏洞","description":"dompdf 0.6.1 之前版本的 dompdf.php 中存在路径遍历漏洞。当服务端启用 DOMPDF_ENABLE_PHP 配置时，远程攻击者可通过向 input_file 参数传入 php://filter/read=convert.base64-encode/resource 等 PHP 流封装器协议，绕过 chroot 保护机制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响广泛使用 dompdf 库的 Web 应用，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-2383"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-04-28T14:09:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:06:31Z","remediation":"升级 dompdf 至 0.6.1 或更高版本。如无法升级，在 dompdf 配置中设置 `DOMPDF_ENABLE_PHP=false` 禁用 PHP 执行功能，并严格校验 `input_file` 参数仅允许白名单内的合法路径，同时配置 Web 服务器禁止对 `dompdf.php` 的直接外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Apr/258","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/531912/100/0/threaded","https://explore.avertium.com/resource/lfi-rfi-escalation-to-rce","https://github.com/dompdf/dompdf/commit/23a693993299e669306929e3d49a4a1f7b3fb028","https://www.portcullis-security.com/security-research-and-downloads/security-advisories/cve-2014-2383/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/33004","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2383.yaml","https://github.com/Relativ3Pa1n/CVE-2014-2383-LFI-to-RCE-Escalation"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0198","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-1776","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 6至11版本中存在一处释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，位于CMarkup::IsConnectedToPrimaryMarkup函数中。远程攻击者可通过构造特制网页诱导用户访问，触发已释放内存的非法访问，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞在2014年4月已被野外利用，影响范围广泛。微软已发布安全更新修复，禁用VGX.DLL可作为临时缓解措施。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-1776"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-04-27T10:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:05:32Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS14-021 提供的 Internet Explorer 累积安全更新 (KB2965111)。Windows 用户可通过 Windows Update 自动获取并安装此更新，也可从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载对应 IE 版本的更新包。对于无法立即打补丁的系统，临时缓解措施包括：以管理员身份运行命令 `regsvr32.exe -u \"%CommonProgramFiles%\\Microsoft Shared\\VGX\\vgx.dll\"` 注销 VGX.DLL 组件，或将 Internet 安全区域设置为\"高\"以阻止 ActiveX 控件和活动脚本运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2014/04/30/protection-strategies-for-the-security-advisory-2963983-ie-0day.aspx","http://secunia.com/advisories/57908","http://securitytracker.com/id?1030154","http://www.fireeye.com/blog/uncategorized/2014/04/new-zero-day-exploit-targeting-internet-explorer-versions-9-through-11-identified-in-targeted-attacks.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/222929","http://www.osvdb.org/106311","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/67075","http://www.signalsec.com/cve-2014-1776-ie-0day-analysis/","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-021","https://technet.microsoft.com/library/security/2963983","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2014-1776-use-after-free-vulnerability-in-microsoft-internet-explorer-detection-script","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2014-1776-use-after-free-vulnerability-in-microsoft-internet-explorer-mitigation-scripts","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-1776","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-1776.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2014/1xxx/CVE-2014-1776.json","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/18%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/paloaltonetworks_tale-3-vulnerabilities-cve-2014-1776-exploit-linked-previous-attacks.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-1776/README_KO.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-1776.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/SSVC/data/2014/CVE-2014-1776.json","https://github.com/t-d-k/LibreCrypt/blob/96f35c2b668023f9e44eaa15dde7ec933789708d/docs/FAQ.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2014.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0198.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2014/EXP-AVE-2014-0198.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0109","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-0780","title":"施耐德电气 InduSoft Web Studio 路径遍历漏洞","description":"InduSoft Web Studio 7.1 SP2 Patch 4 之前版本的 NTWebServer 组件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过发送特制的 Web 请求，利用目录遍历漏洞读取 APP 文件中的管理员密码，进而实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 InduSoft Web Studio 7.1 SP2 Patch 4 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击无需身份认证且无需用户交互，攻击复杂度低，影响范围广，危害等级严重。攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列的 Web 请求，绕过路径限制访问敏感文件，获取管理员凭证进而完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-0780"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-04-25T05:12:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:03:37Z","remediation":"立即升级至 InduSoft Web Studio 7.1 SP2 Patch 4 或更高版本（现 AVEVA Plant SCADA），补丁可从 AVEVA 官方支持门户下载。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 或 ..\\ 的路径遍历请求，同时限制 NTWebServer 服务仅监听内网 IP，禁止公网直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.indusoft.com/71.2.4/IWS71.2.4.zip","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/67056","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-14-107-02","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42699/","http://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-14-107-02","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-0780","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42699","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-0780.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2014/0xxx/CVE-2014-0780.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-0780","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-0780.rules","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-0780.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2014/0xxx/CVE-2014-0780.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-0780/README.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/28533.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-0780.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-0780.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0011","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-2908","title":"西门子 SIMATIC S7-1200 CPU 集成Web服务器跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Siemens SIMATIC S7-1200 CPU 设备集成 Web 服务器存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制请求注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，在认证用户浏览器中执行恶意脚本，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 SIMATIC S7-1200 CPU 2.x 及 3.x 系列固件版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。用户应升级固件至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2014-2908"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-04-25T05:12:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:07:21Z","remediation":"将 SIMATIC S7-1200 CPU 固件升级至 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复集成 Web 服务器的 XSS 漏洞。如无法升级，在管理界面禁用集成 Web 服务器功能，或通过防火墙规则限制对 Web 服务器端口 (80/443) 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-14-114-02","http://www.siemens.com/innovation/pool/de/forschungsfelder/siemens_security_advisory_ssa-892012.pdf","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-892012.pdf","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44687/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44687","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2908.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-2908.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/edc652d6e05ef25aee5fb9d5d13e49f90fcfe6b7/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2908.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-2908/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-2908.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2